{"text": "Long ago, there lived a king who was half barbaric. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His ideas were large and wild, and he had the power to turn them into facts. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When everything went as he wished, he was gentle and friendly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But when something went wrong, he was even more gentle and friendly, for nothing pleased him more than making crooked things straight. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He built a huge public arena with seats all around it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the arena was not for sports or fights between men and wild animals. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was a place where justice was decided by chance alone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When a man was accused of a crime, his fate was decided in this arena. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king believed that this system was perfectly fair.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "o", "n", "g", " ", "a", "g", "o", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "h", "a", "l", "f", " ", "b", "a", "r", "b", "a", "r", "i", "c", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "i", "s", " ", "i", "d", "e", "a", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "l", "a", "r", "g", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "i", "l", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "o", "w", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "u", "r", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "f", "a", "c", "t", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", "y", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "a", "s", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "s", "h", "e", "d", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "g", "e", "n", "t", "l", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d",